SUMMARY:The Arts Guild of Sonoma Presents: Embracing Art Reception
DESCRIPTION:The Arts Guild of Sonoma presents Guest Artist Donna Loftus\, opening April 29 at its historic downtown gallery. Loftus\, a Marin-raised artist\, creates expressive abstract\, landscape\, and still life paintings inspired by her connection to color and nature. The exhibition also features works by Guild members across a variety of media. Featured Arts Guild Artist: Tricia O’Brien. Experience original art by original artists. Reception May 7\, 5 – 7 PM. Open Wednesday through Monday\, 11 AM–5 PM. 140 East Napa Street\, Sonoma. Free admission.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-arts-guild-of-sonoma-presents-embracing-art-reception/
