SUMMARY:Juke Tannins at Rio Nido Roadhouse
DESCRIPTION:PHILADELPHIA ROOTS. SONOMA SOUL. THE LIVING RECORD COLLECTION. \nMUSICAL FARM-TO-FORK. \nTHE SOMMELIER OF SOUND. \n  \nPhiladelphia Roots. Sonoma Soul. \n  \nJuke Tannins is what happens when you take a veteran East Coast musician\, arm him with a curated vault of American music\, and drop him in the middle of Wine Country. \nWith over 35 years of live performance experience—from the dive bars of Philadelphia to the tasting rooms of Santa Rosa—Juke isn’t just a “guy with a guitar.” He is a musical historian and a master of reading the room. \nThe Repertoire \nThe Stats: Over 500 covers committed to memory. \nThe Range: From Prine to Prince. Little Feat to Lana Del Rey. Beatles\, Stones\, Motown\, and the “One Hit Wonders” you forgot you loved. \nThe Originals: A deep catalog of acclaimed original songwriting that captures the grit of the road and the odd\, weird beauty of American life. \nOne guy. Six strings. Pure atmosphere.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/juke-tannins-at-rio-nido-roadhouse/
LOCATION:Rio Nido Roadhouse\, 14540 Canyon 2 Road\, Rio Nido\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.5205;-122.979
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Rio Nido Roadhouse 14540 Canyon 2 Road Rio Nido CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=14540 Canyon 2 Road:geo:-122.979,38.5205
END:VEVENT
