SUMMARY:Midnight Sun Massive at Cafe Frida
DESCRIPTION:WINNERS OF THE 2013 & 2011 S.F. NORTH BAY MUSIC AWARD FOR BEST WORLD/REGGAE BAND! \nHailing from the San Francisco Bay Area’s Wine Country\, MIDNIGHT SUN MASSIVE (formerly Midnight Sun) is a 7-piece Reggae & Caribbean music band that combines potent rhythms from around the world with party-oriented\, lovers and conscious lyrics that move your body and mind. Co-Founded by Milo Karobi and Andre Russell\, they are a collection of multi-instrumentalists and songwriters\, each drawing from their diverse backgrounds to combine an endlessly joyful and socially relevant combination of Reggae\, Soca\, Dancehall\, Ska & Calypso. Midnight Sun Massive has shared the stage with such Reggae luminaries as Jimmy Cliff\, Toots & The Maytals\, Junior Toots\, Pato Banton\, The Melodians\, Black Uhuru\, Romain Virgo\, Perfect\, Prince Alla\, Rocker-T\, Prezident Brown\, Sister Carol\, Groundation and many others.\nMIDNIGHT SUN MASSIVE delivers a one-of-a-kind stage show with their signature Conscious Reggae Island Dance Party sound that has wide appeal for all to dance and enjoy.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/midnight-sun-massive-at-cafe-frida-2/
LOCATION:Cafe Frida Gallery\, 300 South A Street #4\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.43412;-122.71481
